{"4468180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AI Society", "steam_appid": 4468180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Society is an civilization simulation game where every character is driven by a  local AI model.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create up to 25 unique characters and define who they are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Set personality traits; how peaceful, hardworking, extroverted, generous, playful, or dominant they are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Give them hobbies like fishing, wood carving, or leatherworking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Write a freeform description to shape their worldview and backstory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Choose their appearance and gender</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters in AI Society are fully autonomous. They will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Find jobs and fill roles in the town's economy based on their personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Earn and spend money, manage hunger, and seek rest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Form relationships, some warm, some tense, based on their traits and interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Characters can get married and have children to continue their legacy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Post thoughts, reactions, and confrontations on their own social media</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Visit the homes and farms of their neighbors, or gather at the tavern for a drink after work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Fight with characters they despise, and if things go badly, die permanently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Drop what they're doing to swarm and attack the intruders when the town is getting raided by bandits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a character dies, they're gone. Their job goes unfilled. Their relationships dissolve. They're remembered in the town cemetery, where others may visit their grave. With a revive token, they can be brought back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your town and rank by going on adventures and reaching milestones in your town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•   Play mini-games, dungeon raids, or town rivals to gain XP for your town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•   Reach milestones in your town, such as defending your first bandit raid, and earn XP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games or fight your way through dungeons &amp; town rivals with your characters to gain town XP and win artifacts that gives them special perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Rare, epic, &amp; exclusive legendary drops when you complete a dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Win more artifacts for your characters when you beat a mini-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Play 6 different mini-games and 5 tiered dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Battle &amp; go on raids with the strongest characters in your civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  When characters die in a dungeon, they die permanently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Go into battle with your town's population and fight off the other town rivals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the town or the characters with your god powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Put thoughts in character's heads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Force a confrontation or an encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Cause chaos and smite town resources or exile your characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Watch your characters react to your decisions on their social media</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Heal characters before dungeon raids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Pick up characters and drop them where you'd like on the map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Society runs entirely on your machine using Ollama. No internet required, no subscriptions/monthly payments, no data sent anywhere. Works with LM Studio. Choose the model that fits your hardware:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Llama 3.2 1B - Lightweight, runs on almost anything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Llama 3.1 8B - Best character quality and depth (Recommended)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Gemma 2 2B - An alternative lightweight option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation, every social media post, every decision your townsfolk make is generated live by the AI model you select.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linux Users:</strong> GPU acceleration works automatically for NVIDIA GPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMD GPU Users:</strong> install ollama via curl -fsSL  | sh for GPU support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without it, AMD GPUs will run on CPU (slower but functional).</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Society is an civilization simulation game where every character is driven by a  local AI model.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create up to 25 unique characters and define who they are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Set personality traits; how peaceful, hardworking, extroverted, generous, playful, or dominant they are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Give them hobbies like fishing, wood carving, or leatherworking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Write a freeform description to shape their worldview and backstory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Choose their appearance and gender</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters in AI Society are fully autonomous. They will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Find jobs and fill roles in the town's economy based on their personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Earn and spend money, manage hunger, and seek rest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Form relationships, some warm, some tense, based on their traits and interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Characters can get married and have children to continue their legacy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Post thoughts, reactions, and confrontations on their own social media</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Visit the homes and farms of their neighbors, or gather at the tavern for a drink after work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Fight with characters they despise, and if things go badly, die permanently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Drop what they're doing to swarm and attack the intruders when the town is getting raided by bandits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a character dies, they're gone. Their job goes unfilled. Their relationships dissolve. They're remembered in the town cemetery, where others may visit their grave. With a revive token, they can be brought back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your town and rank by going on adventures and reaching milestones in your town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•   Play mini-games, dungeon raids, or town rivals to gain XP for your town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•   Reach milestones in your town, such as defending your first bandit raid, and earn XP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini-games or fight your way through dungeons &amp; town rivals with your characters to gain town XP and win artifacts that gives them special perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Rare, epic, &amp; exclusive legendary drops when you complete a dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Win more artifacts for your characters when you beat a mini-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Play 6 different mini-games and 5 tiered dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Battle &amp; go on raids with the strongest characters in your civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  When characters die in a dungeon, they die permanently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Go into battle with your town's population and fight off the other town rivals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the town or the characters with your god powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Put thoughts in character's heads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Force a confrontation or an encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Cause chaos and smite town resources or exile your characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Watch your characters react to your decisions on their social media</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Heal characters before dungeon raids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•  Pick up characters and drop them where you'd like on the map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Society runs entirely on your machine using Ollama. No internet required, no subscriptions/monthly payments, no data sent anywhere. Works with LM Studio. Choose the model that fits your hardware:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Llama 3.2 1B - Lightweight, runs on almost anything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Llama 3.1 8B - Best character quality and depth (Recommended)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•       Gemma 2 2B - An alternative lightweight option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation, every social media post, every decision your townsfolk make is generated live by the AI model you select.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linux Users:</strong> GPU acceleration works automatically for NVIDIA GPUs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMD GPU Users:</strong> install ollama via curl -fsSL  | sh for GPU support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without it, AMD GPUs will run on CPU (slower but functional).</p>", "short_description": "Build your society powered by AI characters. Give your townsfolk unique personalities, hobbies, and traits; then watch them work, argue, form friendships, fight on their own, and more. Complete dungeons &amp; play mini-games with your characters to win artifacts. Runs 100% locally on your machine.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468180/b96a00d8440cb5a61ee44637363d72a2f2cd0295/header.jpg?t=1782765164", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468180/a78f1b3a526e9090ec3fd29fd83191059aa3ec07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782765164", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4468180/a78f1b3a526e9090ec3fd29fd83191059aa3ec07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782765164", "website": "https://b8ve.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 / Intel i5 or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 / Intel i7 or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 / Intel i5 or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended